==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 550,000 and increases by 50,000 with each stage.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Archangel Exiel]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, with a delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns.

