==Strategy==
These first ten stages pair up Exiel with multiple hard pushers, although the difficulty of these stages go down if you use the startoff to build up cash. As long as you have enough Crowd Control and enough stackable DPS, these should be very straightforward.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]]: Ramen's very high base HP allows him to tank blows from the supporting peons in addition to Exiel.
*[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]]: Boulder Cat's high health allows it to stall Exiel and the high DPS peons for a while.
*[[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]]: Spammable anti-Angel midranger that quickly tanks chunks out of Exiel's health.
*[[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]]: A unit similar to Mushroom, but with higher standing range and damage.
*[[Ancient Egg: N110 (Rare Cat)|Farmboy Cat]]: An extremely powerful anti-Angel CC with very high uptime. Farmboy's Single Attack means you need to properly run enough damage to allow Farmboy to connect onto Exiel.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]: Gets rid of the peons as well as Aku Gory, and can even tank hits from Exiel if needed. Beware that they don't outrange Exiel's Omni Strike.
*[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]: An anti-Dark midranger who can deal extremely high damage to the Shadow Boxer Ks and Dark Otters while outranging Exiel. Pizza's damage also works as a generalist for the Aku Gory, and his Wave Attack Talent helps him cover the whole field.
*[[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]]: Cyberpunk's long-lasting Slow and incredibly high range makes him extremely useful on this stage.
*[[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]]: while his HP is inferior to Eraser Cat and his variants against non-aliens, he can tank some hits from Exiel, and his warp immunity prevents him from pushing. It may also provide some form of damage thanks to it's weaken immunity.
*[[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Awakened Urs]]: Generic high DPS backliner with Colossus Slayer.
*[[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]]: A unit similar to Urs that trades standing range for high piercing range.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Anti-Angel Nukers: Focus on killing Exiel quickly so you can get to the next ten stages faster. Examples include [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]], [[Colossal Benkei]], [[Dynasaurus Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Dynasaurus Cat]], and [[Obliterator Diabolosa]].
*Colossal Slayer Ubers: Units like [[God-Emperor Daliasan]], [[Goddess of Light Sirius (Uber Rare Cat)|Goddess of Sunrise Sirius]], [[Spectral Goth Vega (Uber Rare Cat)|Lady of Deception Vega]] and [[One-Eyed Asuka (Uber Rare Cat)|One-Eyed Asuka]] can deal high damage to Exiel and finish these stages quickly.
*Fest Ubers: Since these stages are so easy, focus on bringing units that can brute force the stage. Examples include [[Kasli the Bane (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli, Daughter of Chaos]] and [[Mighty Lord Gao]].

